      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRINGVALE RAELS (6) got the job done again after running them ragged to make it back to back wins, scoring at this track over 342m (19.72). Has good early speed and can overcome the tricky draw. In form and can go on with it. OUR BELLA ROSE (4) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 0.8 lengths second (19.89) behind Goldie Rusty at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and nine minor placings to her credit. Must be included in calculations. SKETCHY TOBY (3) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (19.94) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning nine races. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Leading chance. TODD'S LUKA (1) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
